      "description": "A scene depicting a 'DANGER MINES' warning sign mounted on a metal post, positioned in front of a barbed wire fence, with tall grass surrounding the area. The scene is juxtaposed with the text 'when you step on a landmine but you do not weigh enough,' creating a darkly humorous analogy about being too light to trigger a landmine.",
